#. ja: 現在、「星芒祭」が開催中です。<br>もしよければ、グリダニアにいる実行委員長、<br>「アム・ガランジ」から話を聞いてみてくださいね！
#. de: Das Sternenlichtfest ist in vollem Gang, und es gibt noch viel zu tun. Amh Garanjy in Gridania hält nach weiteren Kleinen Helferlein Ausschau.
#. fr: <if ($gn11 < 12)><if ($gn11 < 4)>Bonsoir<else>Bonjour</if><else><if ($gn11 < 17)>Bonjour<else>Bonsoir</if></if>, je suis un disciple du saint. Encore une fois, le temps de la fête des étoiles est venu<nbsp>! Si vous voulez tout savoir, n'hésitez pas à vous adresser à Amh Garanjy, à Gridania. C'est elle qui se charge de l'or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tion des divertissements<nbsp>!
# aeria-terms: {"Amh Garanjy":"04017f16c5c9","Gridania":"126b6bab8bfc","Starlight Celebration":"8276c8901837"}
msgctxt "custom/004/FesXms2017Mount_00439:TEXT_FESXMS2017MOUNT_00439_COMMITTEE00439_000_000:1"
msgid "As you have no doubt noticed, the Starlight Celebration is in full swing. Would you like to join the festivities? Amh Garanjy is in Gridania looking for more little helpers!"
msgstr "Как вы уже, наверное, заметили, сейчас вовсю идёт Звёздное торжество. Хотите присоединиться к празднику? Ам Гаранжи в Гридании ищет помощников!"

#. ja: 確保については、我々、実行委員がやっておきますので、<br><switch $gn71><case>コカブ<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>フェルカド<case>コカブ<case>ポラリス<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>ポラリス<case>コカブ</switch>に騎乗して、犯トレントの無力化をお願いします！
#. de: Reite auf <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> und lass ihn Sternenknaller auf die diebischen Baumschrate werfen. Sobald sie betäubt sind, sammeln wir den gestohlenen Festschmuck ein.
#. fr: Vous cherchez <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch><nbsp>? Ne vous en faites pas, il a su retrouver son chemin jusqu'ici. Je vais l'appeler tout de suite. Comme ça, vous pourrez retourner régler leur compte à ces tréants de malheur. Bonne chance<nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
# aeria-terms: {"Kochab":"0e2d1a053479","Pferkad":"1d6348a541a3","Polaris":"5686ce838b11","face":"9a4aea3bb0ee","treant":"d922cdf10f6d"}
msgctxt "custom/004/FesXms2017Mount_00439:TEXT_FESXMS2017MOUNT_00439_COMMITTEE00439_000_010:1"
msgid "You can leave trussing up the treants and recovering the stolen decorations to us. All you need to do is ride <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> and give those thieves a face full of starburst!"
msgstr "Оставьте нам связывать энтам лапки и возвращать украденные украшения. Вам остаётся только оседлать <switch $gn71><case>Кохаба<case><if $gn4>Кохаба<else>Полярис</if><case>Феркада<case>Кохаба<case>Полярис<case><if $gn4>Кохаба<else>Полярис</if><case>Полярис<case>Кохаб</switch> и шарахнуть в этих воришек звёздным зарядом!"

#. ja: また、犯トレントの無力化を手伝ってくれるんですか？<br>それじゃあ、<switch $gn71><case>コカブ<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>フェルカド<case>コカブ<case>ポラリス<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>ポラリス<case>コカブ</switch>を呼んでくるので、<br>準備がよければ、騎乗してください！
#. de: Möchtest du Jagd auf die übrigen Baumschrat-Diebe machen? <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> steht für dich bereit.
#. fr: J'ai aperçu quelques tréants hauts en couleur qui vous avaient échappé. Je peux appeler <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> à tout moment, si vous vous sentez prêt<if $gn4>e</if> à en assommer encore quelques-uns. Plus nous récupérerons nos décorations volées, plus les enfants auront le sourire<nbsp>!
#. macro: <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
# aeria-terms: {"Kochab":"0e2d1a053479","Pferkad":"1d6348a541a3","Polaris":"5686ce838b11","treant":"d922cdf10f6d"}
msgctxt "custom/004/FesXms2017Mount_00439:TEXT_FESXMS2017MOUNT_00439_COMMITTEE00439_000_020:1"
msgid "Would you like to hunt down some more decoration-pinching treants? <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> is ready to go!"
msgstr "Хотите выследить ещё несколько энтов-воришек? <switch $gn71><case>Кохаб<case><if $gn4>Кохаб<else>Полярис</if><case>Феркад<case>Кохаб<case>Полярис<case><if $gn4>Кохаб<else>Полярис</if><case>Полярис<case>Кохаб</switch> уже готово к выезду!"

#. ja: <switch $gn71><case>コカブ<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>フェルカド<case>コカブ<case>ポラリス<case><if $gn4>コカブ<else>ポラリス</if><case>ポラリス<case>コカブ</switch>に騎乗しますか？
#. de: Auf <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch> reiten?
#. fr: Voulez-vous chevaucher <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch><nbsp>?
#. macro: <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
# aeria-terms: {"Kochab":"0e2d1a053479","Pferkad":"1d6348a541a3","Polaris":"5686ce838b11","mount":"3943e4b3f165"}
msgctxt "custom/004/FesXms2017Mount_00439:TEXT_FESXMS2017MOUNT_00439_Q1_000_000:1"
msgid "Mount <switch $gn71><case>Kochab<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Pferkad<case>Kochab<case>Polaris<case><if $gn4>Kochab<else>Polaris</if><case>Polaris<case>Kochab</switch>? "
msgstr "Оседлать <switch $gn71><case>Кохаба<case><if $gn4>Кохаба<else>Полярис</if><case>Феркада<case>Кохаба<case>Полярис<case><if $gn4>Кохаба<else>Полярис</if><case>Полярис<case>Кохаб</switch>?"
